:"In `character_body_2d.cpp`, there is code whose compilation is controlled by `DISABLE_DEPRECATED`, including\r\n```cpp\r\n#ifndef DISABLE_DEPRECATED\r\n#include \"servers/physics_2d/physics_server_2d_extension.h\"\r\n#endif\r\n```\r\nWhen compiling with the `deprecated=no` option, `physics_server_2d.h`—which is indirectly included by that header—is also excluded; consequently, any code accessing `PhysicsServer2D` results in a compilation error(`name followed by '::' must be a class or namespace name`).\r\n<img width=\"1128\" height=\"129\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e0a54e7d-5b08-4e10-a385-9422c1b8b0b7\" />","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followe